      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is in my opinion a good thing, cause normally I would consider it a UI setting, but for a lot of others it can be an Accessibility option.\n\nIn general the Accessibility Category is often just a place for settings from other parts of the Menu which also contribute to Accessibility.\n\nThis way you keep settings were they belong, while also allowing people who need these settings for Accessibility to quickly find them in one place.",
